<title>POLAND: RELPOL SIGNS 4.7 MLN MARK FORWARD.</title>
<headline>RELPOL SIGNS 4.7 MLN MARK FORWARD.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-09-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish electromagnetic transmitter exporter Relpol SA has signed forward contracts worth 4.65 million marks and $300,000 from January 1 to July 31 of next year, the firm's financial director said.</p>
<p>&quot;We signed our first contract for the sale of foreign currency in February of this year and now we're extending it for further months,&quot; Roza Jurkowska-Maslak told Reuters.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
